Strategy decision gates between stages
title end

paragraph start
Each stage ends at a gate: a short list of conditions that must be true before moving on. The gate decides between continue, change and stop. Gates use numbers from the success metrics page, never feelings.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
gate after stage zero   launch readiness checklist complete
gate after stage one    routine held for thirty days
gate after stage two    a repeatable winning format found
gate after stage three  income covers costs
code end

paragraph start
todo: set the number for each gate
The owner sets them after the first review.
paragraph end

